.TH HTTP 3 "2026" "y-- standard library" "y-- Library Reference"
.SH NAME
Http \- HTTP client and server
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B Http
module provides HTTP client functions (Get, Post, Put, Delete) and an
HTTP/HTTPS server.  Uses the cpp-httplib library.
.PP
HTTP responses are HttpResponse instances with fields
.B status (int)
and
.B body (string).
A completely failed request returns
.B none().
.PP
HTTPS requires OpenSSL support compiled in; otherwise RuntimeError is raised.
.SH "CLIENT FUNCTIONS"
.SS Get
HttpResponse() Get(url: string(), path: string())
.br
HTTP GET request.  url = base URL, path = resource path.
.SS Post
HttpResponse() Post(url, path, body: string(), contentType: string())
.br
HTTP POST with body and content type.
.SS Put
HttpResponse() Put(url, path, body: string(), contentType: string())
.br
HTTP PUT with body and content type.
.SS Delete
HttpResponse() Delete(url: string(), path: string())
.br
HTTP DELETE request.
.SH "SERVER FUNCTIONS"
.SS Server
HttpServerObj() Server()
.br
Creates an HTTP server.  Methods:
.RS
.TP
Get(path, lambda)
Register a GET route handler.
.TP
Post(path, lambda)
Register a POST route handler.
.TP
set_mount_point(mount, dir)
Serve static files from dir at mount path.
.TP
listen(host, port)
Start the server (blocks).
.RE
.SS SSLServer
HttpsServerObj() SSLServer(certPath, keyPath)
.br
Creates an HTTPS server (requires OpenSSL).  Same methods as Server.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
Socket(3), Json(3)
